\newlabel{fig:kstar_theta}{{3}{6}{$\Kempirical (\theta )$ sensitivity curve for five configurations. $\Kempirical $: maximum discriminable depth; $\theta $: AUC decision threshold. Four of five configurations yield $\Kempirical {=}2$ at $\theta {=}0.60$ (dashed line); OLMo yields $\Kempirical {=}1$. At $\theta {=}0.70$, all drop to $\Kempirical {=}1$}{figure.caption.10}{}}
